>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b650b550-9fca-475a-b2f0-72328e6d9ffe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b650b550-9fca-475a-b2f0-72328e6d9ffe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a counter at <a href=\"/wiki/Flymm%27s_Cobblers\" title=\"Flymm's Cobblers\">Flymm's Cobblers</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-35&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-115</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Ledger of orders received and fulfilled at Flymm's cobbler shop. After a moderate listing of jobs in and out, there is a large order for 26 pairs of <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Flaming Fist</a> Scout Boots, due for delivery at <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock\">Wyrm's Rock</a> at the end of the current tenday. The order has been underlined three times, with a note in the margin that reads, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tymora\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"'Tymora's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Tymora\">'Tymora's</a></span> tits, we'll never get this done in time! ...I mean, how generous.']\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202704\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1795/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33179/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9150/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936315/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.251      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.251      1 -total\n 56.14%   24.843      8 Template:Icon_text\n 49.67%   21.980     19 Template:Trim\n 22.42%    9.921      2 Template:Uid\n 15.13%    6.696      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.88%    6.584      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.26%    5.868      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.22%    4.521      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.09%    4.465      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34575-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202704 and revision id 321923. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}